   <text>
      <body><div><pb facs="#facs_0045_03_07_1322-01" n="0045_03_07_1322-01" xml:id="img_0045_03_07_1322-01"/>
            <ab>
               <l facs="#facs_0045_03_07_1322-01_tr_1_tl_1">Wi Andries tuclāt en̄ Jan de roede . scepenen in Antwʼpen maken cont dat vore ons qᵃm̄ Gilijs . claus</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0045_03_07_1322-01_tr_1_tl_2">en̄ jan kindʼe gilijs wilmaers wonachtech wilen was inde houtmere . en̄ de vorseide jan</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0045_03_07_1322-01_tr_1_tl_3">met sinen montbore hem ghegheuen metden rechte . En̄ bekinden en̄ vʼliden dat alle</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0045_03_07_1322-01_tr_1_tl_4">dat guet dat si houdende sijn dat com̄ es van gilise wilmare horen oudʼuader</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0045_03_07_1322-01_tr_1_tl_5">wilen was waert gheleghen es . Es half ꝓper guet heʼn steuens wilmaers hoers oems</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0045_03_07_1322-01_tr_1_tl_6">caplaens van onser vrouwen kʼke in antwʼpen sinen vrien wille met tedoene . Ende</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0045_03_07_1322-01_tr_1_tl_7">gheloefden dat si den vorseiden heʼn steuene in dese heleft van alden vorseiden guede</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0045_03_07_1322-01_tr_1_tl_8">laten selen altoes onghestoert en̄ onghecalangiert . En̄ dat si daer jeghen in̄mʼmeer seg</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0045_03_07_1322-01_tr_1_tl_9">ghen noch doen en selen bi hen selven noch bi anderʼ in en gheven manieren. In kīnessen</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0045_03_07_1322-01_tr_1_tl_10">van desen lettʼen bezeghelt met onsen seglen . Ghegheuen int jaer ons heʼn alsm̄ screef . M .</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0045_03_07_1322-01_tr_1_tl_11">CCC . en̄ tuee en̄ tuintech des satʼdaegs na sente peters en̄ sente pauwels dach</l>
            </ab>
      </div></body>
   </text>
